('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000335', 'reading', 11, '{"passage": "Closing a negotiation successfully requires precision. Once both sides agree, lawyers draft the contract, making it binding when signed. Certain requirements remain non-negotiable throughout the process, and if talks stall, the issue may need to escalate to senior management. Ultimately, both parties want to finalize a deal and settle the matter for good.", "translation": "Fechar uma negociação com sucesso exige precisão. Assim que os dois lados concordam, os advogados redigem o contrato, tornando-o vinculante quando assinado. Certos requisitos permanecem não negociáveis durante todo o processo, e se as conversas travarem, a questão pode precisar ser escalada para a alta gerência. No fim, as duas partes querem finalizar um acordo e resolver a questão de vez.", "question": "What happens to certain requirements throughout the process, according to the text?", "options": ["They become flexible", "They remain non-negotiable", "They are removed"], "correct_index": 1}'),
('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000335', 'listening', 12, '{"audio_text": "We hope to finalize the agreement by Friday. The agreement becomes binding once both parties sign. The safety requirements are non-negotiable.", "question": "When does the agreement become binding, according to the audio?", "options": ["Once both parties sign", "Once it is drafted", "Once it is escalated"], "correct_index": 0}'),
